9,"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97%E6%B7%85%E5%B7%9D%E4%B8%8B%E5%AF%BA%E6%A5%9A%E5%A2%93-%E9%84%AC%E5%AD%90%E5%80%97%E6%B5%B4%E7%BC%B6-%E6%98%A5%E7%A7%8B-%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%99%A2.jpg/1280px-%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97%E6%B7%85%E5%B7%9D%E4%B8%8B%E5%AF%BA%E6%A5%9A%E5%A2%93-%E9%84%AC%E5%AD%90%E5%80%97%E6%B5%B4%E7%BC%B6-%E6%98%A5%E7%A7%8B-%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%99%A2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail",24,{"$s":1455},148,{"$s":1456},29,"CC BY-SA 4.0 · Kcx36",63,1280,64,961,160,"629469bf3b3915e8cca41aba88a5fa9e06239d7c",4,"File:河南淅川下寺楚墓-鄬子倗浴缶-春秋-河南博物院.jpg",161,"​鄬子倗浴缶 春秋（前770—前476年） 河南淅川下寺楚墓出土 河南博物院藏 此器为国家一级文物。有盖，小口，方唇，直沿，低领，广肩，鼓腹，平底，矮圈足。盖顶圆鼓，上有竖环钮四个。肩部两侧有对称的链环耳两个。器表上饰满铸镶上去的红铜动物和几何形花纹。盖顶花纹有四组，正中铸镶红铜涡纹一个。涡纹外有夔龙纹四个，菱龙纹之外铸蠕纹带一周，蟠螭纹带之间铸镶红铜涡纹六个。盖沿上部又铸镶夔纹十个。器身花纹上下可分七组：肩上铸镶云纹、亚腰形纹及夔龙纹带各一组。腹上有凸起的蟠螭纹带一周，带间铸镶圆涡纹十二个。腹下铸镶菱龙纹、亚腰形纹及云纹各一组。从此缶可看出当时高超的铸镶工艺水平。盖上及口沿上均铸有相同铭文：“楚叔之孙鄬子倗之浴缶”。 Bronze Fou by Peng Spring and Autumn Period(770B.C.-476B.C.) Unearthed from the Chu Tombs in Xiasi, Xichuan County, Henan Province Henan Museum",67,true,49,175723,50,"cec5134c1242935f98676613c231630b1e9f79970a9f1807e0d2d6f6c4fcf369",151,"f1e830483a5a763e7221710c6ecdb7961581c141e5fb26dda1483f9cbc6a54c3",152,"0010101101101001001011101000111010011100111110000111000111110001",153,"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97%E6%B7%85%E5%B7%9D%E4%B8%8B%E5%AF%BA%E6%A5%9A%E5%A2%93-%E9%84%AC%E5%AD%90%E5%80%97%E6%B5%B4%E7%BC%B6-%E6%98%A5%E7%A7%8B-%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%99%A2.jpg/1280px-%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97%E6%B7%85%E5%B7%9D%E4%B8%8B%E5%AF%BA%E6%A5%9A%E5%A2%93-%E9%84%AC%E5%AD%90%E5%80%97%E6%B5%B4%E7%BC%B6-%E6%98%A5%E7%A7%8B-%E6%B2%B3%E5%8D%97%E5%8D%9A%E7%89%A9%E9%99%A2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail",87,"assets/spring-autumn/b0541ea07be2f2e7c127.jpg",154,[],8,{"$s":1459},89,"Kcx36",10,"",32,"2026-10-15"